OL,3,GNEWSACollege merger heads for final
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo further education colleges could
OL,7,Fmerge by January, following the
OL,8,Fcompletion of a public consultation.
OL,10,FNorthampton College and Moulton College
OL,11,Fwant to join forces to create one new
OL,12,Finstitution, which they have said would
OL,13,Fcreate one of the largest further
OL,14,Feducation providers in the region.
OL,16,FThere are currently 12,000 students
OL,17,Faged 16+ and 1,100 staff across the two
OL,18,Fcolleges, both of which are rated Good
OL,19,Fby Ofsted.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
