OL,3,GNEWSACollege merger heads for final
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe merged colleges would be known as
OL,7,Fthe Northampton and Moulton Colleges
OL,8,FGroup, if final approval is granted in
OL,9,FDecember.
